|                    AGENTIC RUNTIME                        |
|  +-------------------+        +------------------------+  |
|  |   Event Loop      | <----- |  Deterministic Injector|  |
|  +-------------------+        +------------------------+  |
+-----------|------------------------------|----------------+
            | (Syscall Interception)       | (Input Injection)
+-----------v------------------------------v----------------+
|            eBPF LSM / Ptrace Interception Layer           |
+---------------------------|-------------------------------+
                            | (Serialized WAL Stream)
+---------------------------v-------------------------------+
|               Immutable Event Log (WAL)                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
```


