## 2. Wire Format, Bytecode & API Specifications

To achieve zero-copy synchronization between the orchestrator control plane and individual AET worker runtimes, the IACP utilizes a tightly packed binary wire format over shared memory regions (`shm_open`) coupled with Unix domain sockets for out-of-band signaling.

### Control Frame Wire Format (Little-Endian)
